# [PC] ingame HUD: select the HQ and use its dial menu (docs/re/ui_phase5.md
# "Phase 5c"), 1280x720, 60 fps clock:
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --skirmish 1 \
#       --frames 400 --input tools/ui/ingame_hq_dial.input
# Checks (the "state" lines on stdout):
#   select_hq: the selection is the HQ (building t1)
#   dial_open: a dial menu is open on it
#   dial_sent: the dial is closed again (cmdProcessDialButton was sent)
30 dump start
40 click left 640 360                  # HQ: left click selects (ACTION_SELECT only)
+2 dump select_hq
50 click right 640 360                 # right click on the selected HQ: the production dial
+2 dump dial_open
60 mousemove 760 300                   # hover a dial button (the angle selection)
+5 screenshot ingame_hq_dial.png
70 key 2                               # number key: the second dial button
+2 dump dial_sent
100 screenshot ingame_after_dial.png
